663
01:25:03,664 --> 01:25:05,809
Itu kotor.

664
01:25:07,136 --> 01:25:08,586
Aku membutuhkan itu!

665
01:25:09,129 --> 01:25:11,791
Ibu hanya mencoba membantumu, Hana.

666
01:25:11,815 --> 01:25:13,425
